    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Facility Unknown</strong> - Is a co-op horror game about exploration of dangerous liminal spaces. Wander around the facility alone or with friends. In any case, your task is to do your job and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/005826a06c0d5a766a7c9aa0e125324d.poster.avif?t=1754418336\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/005826a06c0d5a766a7c9aa0e125324d.webm?t=1754418336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/005826a06c0d5a766a7c9aa0e125324d.mp4?t=1754418336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in co-op with friends or with random players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various devices that will help you survive the mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat will help you complete your tasks, but be cautious enemies can also hear you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels with unique mechanics<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/78f41455dedd6433bfd874c22b848851.poster.avif?t=1754418336\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/78f41455dedd6433bfd874c22b848851.webm?t=1754418336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/78f41455dedd6433bfd874c22b848851.mp4?t=1754418336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beware of entities that can harm you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The boundaries of the mind are blurred, keep an eye on the level of sanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Complete the tasks and extract</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/32e016950d402270ae8685f869245eda.poster.avif?t=1754418336\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/32e016950d402270ae8685f869245eda.webm?t=1754418336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2750970/extras/32e016950d402270ae8685f869245eda.mp4?t=1754418336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various devices that will help you survive the mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Proceed carefully, each step may be the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be vigilant in the face of danger</p></li></ul></p></li></ul>",
